--- Interaction Regression Models ---
Model 1: active_devices ~ update_intensity + rating + update_intensity*rating

  Asia: R² = 0.2313
  active_devices(M) = 1.9205 + -0.2418*upd_intensity + -0.0766*rating + 0.0239*upd_intensity*rating
  Interaction F-test: F=0.0290, p=0.8650

  Europe: R² = 0.1741
  active_devices(M) = -1.6151 + 0.9386*upd_intensity + 0.7335*rating + -0.2566*upd_intensity*rating
  Interaction F-test: F=3.0317, p=0.0833

  North America: R² = 0.2171
  active_devices(M) = 0.6497 + -0.0152*upd_intensity + 0.0265*rating + -0.0105*upd_intensity*rating
  Interaction F-test: F=0.1106, p=0.7398

  South America: R² = 0.1213
  active_devices(M) = 0.6635 + -0.1523*upd_intensity + -0.0879*rating + 0.0318*upd_intensity*rating
  Interaction F-test: F=2.3186, p=0.1295


Model 2: rating ~ update_intensity + active_devices + update_intensity*active_devices

  Asia: R² = 0.0103
  rating = 4.5505 + -0.1502*upd_intensity + -0.0000002407*active + 0.0673*upd_intensity*active
  Interaction F-test: F=0.0111, p=0.9163

  Europe: R² = 0.0175
  rating = 0.3833 + 1.2716*upd_intensity + 0.0000034123*active + -1.1766*upd_intensity*active
  Interaction F-test: F=2.1402, p=0.1451

  North America: R² = 0.0301
  rating = 3.0206 + 0.3908*upd_intensity + 0.0000012305*active + -0.4720*upd_intensity*active
  Interaction F-test: F=0.1776, p=0.6739

  South America: R² = 0.0336
  rating = 6.0994 + -0.7550*upd_intensity + -0.0000078826*active + 2.9241*upd_intensity*active
  Interaction F-test: F=4.2044, p=0.0417


